# SPA fallback when no static file exists (Cloudflare Pages serves real files first).
# Do NOT add /_next/* rewrites — they can cause chunk URLs to return index.html →
# "Uncaught SyntaxError: Unexpected identifier" in main-app-*.js

# Product PDP: pre-rendered slugs use their own HTML; anything else loads the client shell
# (see `PDP_SHELL_SEGMENT` in app/products/[id]/page.js). Without this, /products/new-slug/
# falls through to /* → index.html and Next shows the global 404 page.
/products/*  /products/_pdp/index.html  200

/*  /index.html  200
